@startuml
title Khách hủy đơn COD đang chờ
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Customer
boundary WebApp
control API
control OrderService
entity PostgreSQL

Customer->WebApp: Chọn hủy đơn
WebApp->API: POST /orders/:orderId/cancel
API->OrderService: Verify customer owns order
OrderService->PostgreSQL: BEGIN and lock sales_order row
PostgreSQL-->OrderService: Pending COD order
OrderService->PostgreSQL: Set status cancelled
OrderService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
PostgreSQL-->OrderService: Cancelled order
OrderService-->API: Updated order
API-->WebApp: 200 cancelled
WebApp-->Customer: Cập nhật trạng thái hủy
@enduml
